{"unit_id":"qq-24__dsh-context-window#card-zh","repo":"qq-24/dsh-context-window","commit":"d47ef566fbfef0e36668b501910d9f7f7032960a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-window 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话级上下文窗口控制插件。它在对话输入框右侧提供控制面板，并通过宿主侧服务把窗口覆盖值写入会话日志，再接入自动 compact 的模型窗口判定。用户可以为单个对话设置或清除覆盖值、查看模型默认值、用滑块或数字输入调整窗口，也可选择预设档位；桌面显示气泡面板，窄屏显示底部抽屉。适合希望分别控制不同对话压缩时机的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH Web、Node.js 22 或更新版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:496-581","index.js:592-633","client.js:516-625"]}
{"unit_id":"qq-24__dsh-context-window#card-en","repo":"qq-24/dsh-context-window","commit":"d47ef566fbfef0e36668b501910d9f7f7032960a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-context-window adds per-conversation context controls to DSH web. It saves overrides in session logs and applies them to automatic compaction. Users can compare the model default, set or clear an override, and adjust it with a slider, number field, or presets. Requires DSH web and Node.js 22+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:496-581","index.js:592-633","client.js:516-625"]}
