{"unit_id":"qq-24__dsh-context-window#caveat-1","repo":"qq-24/dsh-context-window","commit":"d47ef566fbfef0e36668b501910d9f7f7032960a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-window 使用前须知：窗口值保存在会话日志；设得高于模型真实容量可能使自动压缩延后并导致服务端返回上下文超限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:541-553","client.js:650-659"]}
